==Battleground==
*4 [[Le'Solar]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 13.33~15.33 seconds<sup>400f~460f</sup>.
*3 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 30~31.33 seconds<sup>900f~940f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'Solar]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[General GreGory]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Try to rush the stage before the 5 Le'Solars stack up. With lower amounts of [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], you'll want to use a Rich Cat and/or [[Cat Combo]]s for easier rushing. Bring units with high damage like [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], along with [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] to give them more opportunities to attack. Save [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] for after the first General GreGory has died and the first Le'Solar's [[Barrier]] has been broken.

If you have all Anti-Starred Alien Treasures, just bring anything that can break Barriers (with or without damage is fine) along with some meatshields, and then you'll be fine.

